# Ginger, Queen of Sweets: the Gingerbrute token's "{1}: This token can't be blocked this turn except by creatures with
# haste." Bot1 activates it on turn 5 for each of its three attacking Gingerbrutes: Bot2's hasty Fanatical Firebrand may
# block one (the tokens trade), the Llanowar Elves without haste may not block another, and the third goes through for 1
# life. A fourth Gingerbrute, made in the same turn's upkeep, stays home.

