Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Gingerbrute#2.Activate(Ability: can't be blocked)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Gingerbrute#3.Activate(Ability: can't be blocked)
[T5 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Gingerbrute#1 > Bot2; Gingerbrute#2 > Bot2; Gingerbrute#3 > Bot2)
[T5 Bot1.DeclareBlockers]
! Bot2.Block(Llanowar Elves > Gingerbrute#2)
Bot2.Block(Fanatical Firebrand > Gingerbrute#1)
[T5 Bot1.End]

